  "description": "The Geekvape Wenax M1 is an incredibly lightweight and portable refillable vape that’s ideal for beginners or any adult vaper who just wants a discreet and convenient pod kit to carry anywhere. The Wenax M1 is so simple to use, with no buttons to press or settings to adjust – simply take a rich, flavoursome MTL (mouth-to-lung) puff whenever the mood takes you. Its fixed 800mAh battery can be charged via USB-C (cable sold separately) in record time, offering up to 2 days use between charging, while adaptive power setting automatically sets the wattage to best suit the pod you use. Wenax M1 refillable pods feature a fixed coil so that when your pod loses its flavour, you simply need to replace it with a new refillable pod. The 2ml pods are best used with nic salt , 50/50 and classic High-PG e-liquids. Explore our wide range of vape liquids and pick the perfect partner for this kit.",
